# Remux at import (ImportRemuxer: the compressed packets copied unchanged, no decode; FLAC and Opus into .m4a, MP3 into .caf)
# of the files whose open or first deep seek is slow, then the remuxed copy opened and resumed cold like the originals.
# Environment: device iPhone18,1, iOS Version 27.0.1 (Build 24A446), Debug build, output at 1 % volume (quiet test runs); at the start: device load averages 18.71 31.00 19.50 (1, 5, 15 min)
